    "body": "**Describe the enhancement:**\r\nIntroduction of the UUID method for the fingerprint processor\r\n\r\n**Describe a specific use case for the enhancement or feature:**\r\nI'm trying to demonstrate gdpr pseudonymization compliance using the filebeat as described in this article using Logstash: https://www.elastic.co/de/blog/gdpr-personal-data-pseudonymization-part-1\r\nTo make the pseudoids bulletproof, I need the UUID method, unfortunately the fingerprint method has no UUID method at the moment.\r\n*UseCaes*\r\nData comes in. I would like to pseudonymize a certain field. Filebeat checks if the data has this field, if so create a new document in the Index Identities, create a mapping and replace the personal data with a pseudoId created by UUID in the Index Events.",
